#: scenario8:scenario8_6651834A_DBF8_44D1_B509_2899ADE4F497
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2c222ad81c6287c24051ad24c5e24ba6574074d5f8d63dbae4d4f8a41a6fb71f
#. default-sha256: e46e4fcbde0dbc40613ccb164a62608133b1fa12cd0fd7dc00bde0a08ade04f4
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_6651834A_DBF8_44D1_B509_2899ADE4F497"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫It’s a lot of pressure being under that much suspicion, huh. ⟪k:3⟫My heart was "
"pounding the whole time."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Comme c’est épuisant de se sentir soupçonné, hein. ⟪k:3⟫Mon cœur battait la "
"chamade tout du long."

#: scenario8:scenario8_E303B542_62C2_46DA_B84D_21909C9B2717
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 77008c6562af31072d2878c7ce55cdae27f2cd409039a21540e6b4d0bf005fa0
#. default-sha256: da910a9085f772d7d3a1124de99a464f60155daca438d74cce20c1edd96cab0f
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_E303B542_62C2_46DA_B84D_21909C9B2717"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Why’d you tell him that, anyway?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Pourquoi vous lui avez sorti ça, d’ailleurs ?"

#: scenario8:scenario8_DF466BE3_9743_4EB8_8C55_126EA0D35B34
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: cb989df64cf9b089531c421089c8d5f37e5a0dba0b19227b3c1a59a932ae80de
#. default-sha256: 2d97fb9f34b03318cb562bcff5bcde95b8b60dc65944f749beb491aaef6cc4a4
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_DF466BE3_9743_4EB8_8C55_126EA0D35B34"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I know, I know!⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Besides, you have every intention of keeping your "
"promise, don’t you?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Je sais, je sais !⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Et de toute façon, vous avez l’intention de tenir "
"votre promesse, non ?"

#: scenario8:scenario8_FA8A3BEE_FC0A_4782_ABA9_359AF754BB23
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7fd54f187be46c7a1d14cbb1a5cae9ed105b996d643a04d39c66762041b000a0
#. default-sha256: 3143d633382e0363ade1f4819672a447a863bf0edffa963362e1b3d5f26e42ef
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_FA8A3BEE_FC0A_4782_ABA9_359AF754BB23"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Hehehe, oh, you. You say it’s all on him,⟪k:3⟫but deep down, you know you’re on "
"his side."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Héhéhé, oh, vous alors. Vous dites que ça dépend de lui,⟪k:3⟫mais au fond vous "
"savez bien que vous êtes de son côté."

#: scenario8:scenario8_0C30FFB8_1082_45EC_9226_126C9FCB72AE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7303bdafa57eb946596639b1873e336ee9cd7f43d2bf9dcf79c9e8182b0e224f
#. default-sha256: 6f67cbdab200136d775248b8a0b56938efc49f406173c6037980957099238e02
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_0C30FFB8_1082_45EC_9226_126C9FCB72AE"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫We’re complete strangers to this Mell,⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫but I can’t bring myself to think "
"of him that way."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Nous sommes de parfaits inconnus pour Mell,⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫mais je n’arrive pas à me "
"résoudre à le voir de cette manière."

#: scenario8:scenario8_13D29103_8E5D_431C_8E27_B9552F151160
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 75f65a79197f5dacc2778de64acb5cfa993e60753ebcfcce040efb10dd2aa4c8
#. default-sha256: 56828a45b0afa2c038788e2cd9d5bf3298cafa777a23b479739ca5659b3e3892
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_13D29103_8E5D_431C_8E27_B9552F151160"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫And you were actually there—⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫a part of his life—⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫which I "
"imagine makes the sentiment all the stronger."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Vous, vous étiez vraiment là —⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫ vous faisiez partie de sa vie —⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫ "
"donc j’imagine que ça doit vous faire encore plus bizarre."

#: scenario8:scenario8_F66292A8_AABF_483E_89EA_5C109E89F5F7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2feaf1643ad17e9f4a5023d16b41d7ddea708572c2b85ea3473420d77a74d582
#. default-sha256: 7a63c544c540f188d6626736b02510661d3575ba559562b834f9323484a3fe2b
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_F66292A8_AABF_483E_89EA_5C109E89F5F7"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫don’t think of him... ⟪k:3⟫as a total stranger, no.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫However..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫...ne le vois pas... ⟪k:3⟫comme un parfait étranger, non.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Cependant..."

#: scenario8:scenario8_07A3BB64_4284_4F38_B51B_D1B2E3F52F55
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a972eb54488965fd3e2e2287357faa961df7fb01b55a07b136752e8f3c54abac
#. default-sha256: 7627ef37a915037aaca5f3ef5b61b7452b0e11266db09dc9c3015adae53346d6
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_07A3BB64_4284_4F38_B51B_D1B2E3F52F55"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫It’s hard to say... ⟪k:3⟫but even if he doesn’t,⟪k:4⟫we still have the other two "
"men to worry about."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Difficile à dire... ⟪k:3⟫mais quand bien même il ne le ferait pas,⟪k:4⟫nous avons "
"encore à nous méfier des deux autres hommes."

