#: scenario8:scenario8_456D304C_18F8_49FE_B699_BB8FB0129127
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9ff15d4b4c5ba315302fb594f4adcc4f2245eeb5643ef362c045958997327b00
