msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫He bears a great deal of regret.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫He yearns for someone to save him."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Il éprouve énormément de regret.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Il désire vivement être sauvé."

#: scenario8:scenario8_4B497D23_0A93_44D8_962E_2C771CB1E1EC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 71a4c7eea45e5bf5a12281d7a7e58f781ed60594bbeb08616adbd4c6c624b4f0
#. default-sha256: 428851dda5832ae1231326d97f3dea71ecce710fa40819184b0d4e5aa5af1d3e
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_4B497D23_0A93_44D8_962E_2C771CB1E1EC"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I heard him muttering, “This isn’t what I wanted.”⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫He doesn’t want to be "
"involved in this."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Je l’ai entendu murmurer : « Ce n’est pas ce que je ⟪k:2⟫voulais ».⟪k:3⟫ Il ne veut pas "
"être impliqué là-dedans."

#: scenario8:scenario8_CFE79328_0AC0_4946_993D_4ECC03795085
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a305e78920acf840bb1b0c9c698cd3b4c80f8ac5ed983c3643516463ed16b351
#. default-sha256: 71f04931c86251c997888632350a4b4971d4bd1d1311fd627f2c84051d684f83
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_CFE79328_0AC0_4946_993D_4ECC03795085"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫But we have knowledge—⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫quite a bit of it, in fact."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Mais nous avons le savoir —⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫ c’est déjà pas mal, en fait."

#: scenario8:scenario8_819984AE_39B1_4789_80C9_A07F1C3C388D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9b68e69ecff92e4a086d4f4e87789a8aff796b1181809ac4585a81c8b556fb38
#. default-sha256: b3df321e3ed1ec7f8130ead3e432f424ab93dfcc3bb196e386aef3abbefe030e
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_819984AE_39B1_4789_80C9_A07F1C3C388D"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I agree! If his darling sister tells him to stop,⟪k:3⟫he won’t have any reason to "
"continue his involvement!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Tout à fait d’accord ! Si sa chère sœur lui dit d’arrêter,⟪k:3⟫il n’aura plus "
"aucune raison de continuer !"

#: scenario8:scenario8_A7B94DFA_E802_4646_8F99_1DB8BD068ED9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bd7dfd311dd215d4ae7eeddcbf0d65800e760a7b01f23030f7c4e716c14123a2
#. default-sha256: f39e337cff5658c797b7469db36a2b7b68aed37f9a103aac2d9e5f1393fc0fd6
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_A7B94DFA_E802_4646_8F99_1DB8BD068ED9"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫is that people tend to keep those they care most about close by."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫...c’est que les gens ont tendance à garder près d’eux ceux qu’ils aiment le plus."

#: scenario8:scenario8_C2FB13F6_DBC2_4FEE_8C81_AC7E38251B75
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: da2d69e690efcd33c5a2ca3864d5a2eeb30380f70f1ced58c3db39ad67ac67fd
#. default-sha256: 58c1146ca18902ac73dee01d4fdf700f143a222a585ffc52f6456ce3766f5ec8
