"⟪k:0⟫(That was entirely unnecessary of me.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Giselle did not need to be reminded of that.)"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫(C’était absolument gratuit de ma part.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Giselle n’a pas besoin qu’on les lui "
"rappelle.)"

