msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫We’ll probably have more luck asking than just searching for her. ⟪k:2⟫If we can’t find "
"Mell, the nun might know."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫On aura probablement plus de chance en posant des questions qu’en partant à sa "
"recherche. ⟪k:2⟫Si on ne trouve pas Mell, la religieuse saura peut-être."

#: scenario8:scenario8_49B91D93_C7F9_4BB2_B3FC_8873EEEDA737
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
