msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫We come from the future, so we know just how dangerous this is..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Nous venons du futur, alors nous savons à quel point c’est dangereux..."

#: scenario8:scenario8_E3C4D349_6165_42E5_9315_528017A9ED61
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 035daaef193f6f3e2c2bde16f368d6a0ee47d926e7412f48a4bdef1474fd118b
